WEBVTT

00:25.540 --> 00:26.560
Here’s the lighttime!

00:26.720 --> 00:28.680
Will you guys click the follow button?

00:28.680 --> 00:29.220
Come on!

00:30.290 --> 00:31.660
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.370 --> 00:34.970
Follow us, please!

00:39.380 --> 00:41.010
I’m gonna make a complaint 
about that funeral home.

00:41.150 --> 00:42.530
How could they schedule 
Min's memorial ceremony

00:42.530 --> 00:44.130
and the police officer's at the same time!

00:46.000 --> 00:48.160
They insist that Liu Min 
was involved in a case.

00:48.750 --> 00:49.930
What on earth is it?

00:50.600 --> 00:52.850
It’s no use knowing too much for a woman.

00:53.860 --> 00:54.770
Now leave us alone.

00:55.260 --> 00:56.750
I’ve got something to talk with Mr. Qian.

01:00.430 --> 01:01.490
Mr. Qian,

01:01.890 --> 01:03.800
you got slapped for my husband.

01:03.970 --> 01:04.800
I’m so sorry.

01:05.350 --> 01:07.520
We take. We give.

01:08.080 --> 01:08.570
It’s what it should be.

01:11.290 --> 01:12.210
Damn it!

01:12.560 --> 01:14.730
At first, it was Zhu being investigated,

01:14.900 --> 01:16.640
and now it's Liu Min.

01:17.080 --> 01:18.580
Obviously, someone wanna mess with me!

01:18.580 --> 01:20.490
Fortunately, it’s Liu Min, 
the worthless one, who died,

01:20.630 --> 01:22.130
removing a burden from my mind.

01:23.260 --> 01:24.620
By the way, what about the phone?

01:24.620 --> 01:25.960
Did you get Liu Min's phone?

01:27.060 --> 01:28.060
There is a little problem.

01:28.350 --> 01:28.990
It’s lost.

01:29.060 --> 01:29.850
What?!

01:30.090 --> 01:30.950
Lost?

01:32.370 --> 01:35.700
Qian Jin, you’ve never messed up anything.

01:35.770 --> 01:37.250
Don't play tricks with me!

01:37.730 --> 01:39.690
I'm not interested in your family's secrets,

01:40.850 --> 01:44.200
but for now, I can assure you that 
the police haven’t got it as well.

01:44.530 --> 01:47.100
Fine, I'll give you another chance.

01:47.410 --> 01:48.880
Get it as soon as possible.

01:49.810 --> 01:51.840
My trust has a limit!

01:55.170 --> 01:57.000
Boss, you’re a genius!

01:57.400 --> 01:59.500
It’s so wise of you

01:59.500 --> 02:00.580
to make arrangements in advance.

02:01.110 --> 02:02.820
They don't have any evidence now,

02:02.820 --> 02:04.030
so when can I get out?

02:04.620 --> 02:06.080
Wait until the detention period is over.

02:07.650 --> 02:09.200
You just said ‘arrangements’,

02:09.780 --> 02:10.560
what do you mean?

02:15.320 --> 02:16.890
You asked that person to be there

02:16.890 --> 02:18.350
and take the phone away, didn’t you?

02:19.060 --> 02:22.500
Otherwise, the phone would still 
be with me when I was caught.

02:22.650 --> 02:24.100
That would be the evidence.

02:27.470 --> 02:30.470
That person suddenly 
appeared in the building.

02:30.470 --> 02:31.840
I was startled then.

02:36.810 --> 02:37.280
Who’s that?

02:42.880 --> 02:44.640
Oh, it’s you.

02:45.100 --> 02:47.050
You almost scared me to 
death with such silence.

02:47.660 --> 02:50.970
What's the matter? Boss doesn’t trust me?

02:52.540 --> 02:55.480
I've got the aftermath covered for you.

02:57.950 --> 02:59.510
What do you mean by that?

03:03.850 --> 03:04.810
Oh, I see!

03:05.810 --> 03:07.820
Brilliant! Brilliant!

03:10.700 --> 03:11.760
I'm leaving now.

03:14.090 --> 03:16.070
You even picked a blind 
spot in the surveillance.

05:17.100 --> 05:19.530
Although we caught Ma and his accomplice,

05:20.200 --> 05:23.480
we don't have enough 
evidence to prosecute him.

05:24.060 --> 05:25.960
So what the hell are those guys?

05:26.620 --> 05:28.690
They are just some vagrants.

05:29.180 --> 05:31.560
But through the investigation 
with Chen Bin's wife,

05:32.000 --> 05:34.900
we learned that Ma went to Chen 
Bin’s house with Qian Jin.

05:34.900 --> 05:37.560
Captain Qian came to our home that night.

05:38.110 --> 05:40.250
To visit Chen Bin and me, he said.

05:40.680 --> 05:42.960
They heard that Chen Bin wouldn't come back,

05:43.740 --> 05:45.500
so they didn't stay long and left soon.

05:47.160 --> 05:47.830
Check this.

05:48.450 --> 05:50.600
Is he the guy who came with Qian Jin?

05:51.410 --> 05:53.010
Yes, that's him!

05:54.410 --> 05:56.870
I thought his behaviour was strange then!

05:57.650 --> 06:01.410
But later, he moved the fruit they 
brought to the kitchen for me.

06:02.030 --> 06:02.570
Oh!

06:03.050 --> 06:05.180
Could it be that during this process,

06:05.340 --> 06:06.940
he put the money under the cabinet!

06:07.890 --> 06:09.240
Why did he wanna frame Chen Bin?

06:09.560 --> 06:10.880
Isn't he with Captain Qian?

06:11.020 --> 06:13.740
Is this case also related to Captain Qian?

06:14.400 --> 06:15.960
Mrs. Chen, calm down.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.940
There's no complete chain of evidence yet,

06:19.700 --> 06:21.570
so we can't explain everything clearly.

06:22.720 --> 06:25.260
Can you recall anything else?

06:25.780 --> 06:27.360
We need as many clues as possible.

06:28.580 --> 06:29.820
I've said everything I remember.

06:30.620 --> 06:31.540
As for others,

06:33.370 --> 06:34.530
I really don’t remember.

06:35.270 --> 06:38.240
Captain Xiao, what kind 
of person is Qian Jin?

06:38.640 --> 06:41.010
Could he be the person 
who can control others?

06:42.040 --> 06:42.670
Right,

06:43.200 --> 06:44.800
the madman has no further action after that.

06:45.670 --> 06:47.100
Maybe he finds that he’s exposed

06:47.380 --> 06:48.660
and decides to lay low for a while?

06:53.460 --> 06:56.060
The one with superpowers 
couldn't be Qian Jin.

06:56.600 --> 06:57.640
I know him too well.

06:58.600 --> 07:00.380
We were classmates at the police academy

07:00.820 --> 07:02.300
and joined the force together.

07:03.260 --> 07:04.760
From my first glance at him,

07:04.760 --> 07:05.580
I knew

07:06.440 --> 07:08.180
he was more righteous

07:08.690 --> 07:09.550
and dedicated than I.

07:10.760 --> 07:12.790
We solved many cases together.

07:13.460 --> 07:14.820
If he had that power,

07:15.040 --> 07:17.210
he wouldn't have risked his life 
and suffered so many injuries.

07:18.160 --> 07:19.440
We were separated later,

07:19.750 --> 07:20.960
and assigned to different 
cases with new colleagues,

07:21.740 --> 07:22.970
so we gradually lost contact.

07:24.370 --> 07:25.260
Until one day...

07:25.950 --> 07:27.660
Xu, take a nap in the car for a while,

07:27.660 --> 07:28.260
I'll drive.

07:28.950 --> 07:30.330
Tell me the address of the crime scene.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.800
Thank you, Captain Qian.

07:32.300 --> 07:36.490
The address is Room 501, Building 4, 
Jiaxing Neighborhood, 59 Qingjia Road.

07:43.680 --> 07:46.490
Qian Jin, you’re finally back.

07:51.760 --> 07:52.810
Seems to be a burglary.

07:53.540 --> 07:54.900
The lady was home.

07:55.130 --> 07:56.560
The burglar didn't hesitate to attack.

07:57.710 --> 07:59.600
Captain Qian, Captain Qian, what's wrong?

08:01.910 --> 08:02.610
Qian Jin!

08:04.100 --> 08:06.490
Now, all of you, get out first!

08:08.220 --> 08:09.930
I didn't know until I got there.

08:10.440 --> 08:12.080
The victim was Qian Jin's wife.

08:13.110 --> 08:15.510
That's why my superiors specially 
assigned me to take over this case.

08:16.410 --> 08:19.940
And, his wife was pregnant when she died.

08:20.940 --> 08:21.960
It was a double tragedy.

08:23.370 --> 08:25.400
Was the criminal caught at last?

08:26.290 --> 08:28.980
The suspect was caught before long,

08:30.060 --> 08:31.580
but due to lack of evidence,

08:32.380 --> 08:34.460
he managed to escape legal 
punishment in the end.

08:36.840 --> 08:38.930
Just half a year after he was acquitted,

08:39.580 --> 08:41.220
he was found dead at home

08:42.380 --> 08:44.060
with a suicide note

08:44.520 --> 08:46.580
confessing to his crime 
on burglary and murdering.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.620
At that time, many people started gossiping,

08:49.890 --> 08:51.710
suspecting that Qian Jin 
killed him for revenge.

08:52.170 --> 08:53.850
So he left the police force

08:54.120 --> 08:55.340
and set up a law firm.

08:57.280 --> 08:58.760
We lost touch for several years after that.

08:59.150 --> 09:02.350
I feel even more distant 
now when we met again.

09:06.010 --> 09:06.520
How about it?

09:07.080 --> 09:08.140
Have you found him?

09:17.050 --> 09:18.880
You are really a madman.

09:19.400 --> 09:21.380
Although this plan is risky,

09:21.810 --> 09:24.590
as long as we can take action 
before the police discover it,

09:25.170 --> 09:26.970
We still have a chance.

09:28.900 --> 09:30.180
Go find more people

09:30.860 --> 09:32.280
in case of unexpected needs.

09:32.870 --> 09:33.810
Yes, Boss.

09:33.860 --> 09:36.450
Captain Xiao, did you come here today?

09:36.450 --> 09:38.020
Because you have something to ask.

09:39.860 --> 09:42.660
Yes, I wanna confirm one thing with Lu Guang.

09:44.830 --> 09:45.460
Lu Guang?

09:47.090 --> 09:49.720
This is the footage we retrieved from 
the building's surveillance cameras.

09:52.510 --> 09:53.540
Who is it?

09:54.240 --> 09:55.010
Let me see.

10:00.390 --> 10:03.100
Lu Guang, who’s this person wearing a hood?

10:03.670 --> 10:05.180
Why do you hide this from us!

10:05.970 --> 10:07.340
Lu Guang, tell me!

10:07.680 --> 10:09.130
You’ve already known something, right?

10:10.710 --> 10:12.920
At this point, Lu Guang,

10:13.690 --> 10:15.080
you don't need to have too 
many concerns any more.

10:21.900 --> 10:24.160
That person gave me this.

10:26.400 --> 10:27.350
What is this?

10:28.210 --> 10:29.730
He was wearing a hood and a mask,

10:30.020 --> 10:31.700
deliberately hiding his face,

10:32.150 --> 10:33.300
without any word.

10:41.880 --> 10:42.510
Wait!

10:50.090 --> 10:52.170
I first thought it was 
just an ordinary photo,

10:55.560 --> 10:57.100
but on the back,

10:57.540 --> 10:59.300
there was a slightly 
blurry children's drawing

11:01.470 --> 11:02.650
and a message.

11:06.960 --> 11:09.600
The drawing and the message 
seem to be left by a child.

11:11.270 --> 11:13.420
What did he give you the photo for?

11:14.270 --> 11:16.060
“Can’t lose my good brother.”

11:17.180 --> 11:20.350
He hopes that we can help 
him find his family member?

11:22.100 --> 11:23.490
By the way, Lu Guang,

11:24.180 --> 11:26.500
didn't you directly investigate 
the situation in the photo?

11:27.500 --> 11:28.410
I tried,

11:28.970 --> 11:30.480
but due to my current condition

11:30.560 --> 11:32.270
I can’t use my power continuously

11:32.420 --> 11:34.360
to see all the details within 12 hours.

11:38.060 --> 11:39.340
Then let me enter the photo,

11:39.800 --> 11:40.820
you just need to guide me

11:40.820 --> 11:42.800
what to do next.

11:43.610 --> 11:45.410
I was reluctant to take out this photo.

11:45.410 --> 11:46.500
And you’re just the reason.

11:46.740 --> 11:48.440
Enter the photo?

11:48.620 --> 11:49.370
What does that mean?

11:49.580 --> 11:52.410
Captain Xiao, they both 
have superpowers actually.

11:52.620 --> 11:53.850
One can enter photos,

11:54.050 --> 11:56.410
the other can perceive what 
will happen in the photo.

11:57.540 --> 11:58.880
Really?

11:59.220 --> 12:00.460
With your abilities,

12:00.610 --> 12:02.330
there would be no unsolvable cases!

12:02.620 --> 12:05.800
But it is dangerous to go back to the past.

12:06.570 --> 12:09.530
Whether the future is changed 
or what has changed.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.610
None of us can predict it.

12:13.380 --> 12:14.810
It makes sense.

12:15.640 --> 12:17.430
Even if the butterfly effect occurs,

12:17.610 --> 12:20.080
we may not be aware of it in the present.

12:20.370 --> 12:21.200
Moreover,

12:21.800 --> 12:23.510
facing the unchangeable past,

12:24.420 --> 12:25.940
can we really let it go?

12:48.830 --> 12:49.810
Let the past be the past.

12:50.330 --> 12:52.060
It’s true that we can't change the past.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.430
But you also said,

12:53.820 --> 12:55.700
the future will change because of us.

12:56.830 --> 12:57.600
Right?

13:03.020 --> 13:05.610
If we can prevent bad things in the future,

13:06.060 --> 13:07.760
I think it's worth trying.

13:08.010 --> 13:10.500
And Captain Xiao needs more clues

13:10.500 --> 13:13.000
to uncover the full story of this 
mysterious person and the whole case.

13:18.440 --> 13:19.180
Fine.

13:19.690 --> 13:20.660
But remember!

13:22.300 --> 13:24.710
First, you only got 12 hours.

13:25.640 --> 13:28.410
Second, follow my lead.

13:30.720 --> 13:34.100
Third, past or future,

13:34.920 --> 13:36.320
just let them be.

13:39.640 --> 13:40.880
It’s true.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.500
He just disappeared like that?

13:42.500 --> 13:44.170
He, he’s in the photo now?

13:50.050 --> 13:52.730
Look, the photo is printed by itself.

13:52.840 --> 13:53.960
Let’s take a look.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.170
How’s your photo?

13:55.660 --> 13:56.140
OK!

13:57.500 --> 13:58.050
Wait,

13:59.500 --> 14:02.450
did you say “OK”?

14:02.680 --> 14:03.410
Don't speak!

14:03.700 --> 14:05.120
This girl seems to be mute.

14:05.640 --> 14:07.140
Don't speak again!

14:07.680 --> 14:10.220
What? She's mute?

14:10.800 --> 14:12.790
You mean the girl in the photo is mute?

14:13.760 --> 14:15.360
Keep looking for more clues.

14:15.600 --> 14:18.480
Take a closer look at the surroundings, 
address, and appearance.

14:18.620 --> 14:18.760
Can he hear any names?

14:18.760 --> 14:19.850
Captain Xiao, don't be too anxious.
Can he hear any names?

14:19.850 --> 14:21.060
Captain Xiao, don't be too anxious.

14:21.250 --> 14:22.530
They are experts.

14:22.640 --> 14:24.820
They will definitely collect the information.

14:25.490 --> 14:26.500
Xixi, try it again, try it again.

14:26.500 --> 14:28.520
Lu Guang, what should I do now?
Xixi, try it again, try it again.

14:28.520 --> 14:29.060
Lu Guang, what should I do now?

14:29.060 --> 14:31.970
You can do it. Just one sentence. Say it.

14:35.210 --> 14:36.570
Xixi, don't cry,

14:36.840 --> 14:38.040
it's my fault.

14:38.260 --> 14:39.850
I shouldn't push you so hard.

14:40.130 --> 14:41.160
OK, OK.

14:41.160 --> 14:43.150
No need to try.

14:43.550 --> 14:46.720
Captain Xiao, why not take 
a rest during this time.

14:46.900 --> 14:49.710
The secret behind that photo 
will soon be revealed.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.660
Well, sorry.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.890
I was a little too anxious just now.

14:53.970 --> 14:57.930
I still have a question in my mind,

14:58.280 --> 15:00.960
why was I controlled?

15:01.140 --> 15:02.570
As we analyzed,

15:03.040 --> 15:05.090
if the person’s ability 
also relies on photos,

15:06.360 --> 15:09.850
you are very likely to have a 
photo somewhere. Think again?

15:10.730 --> 15:12.190
Apart from the Internet,

15:12.480 --> 15:15.290
my parents keep all the photos about my life.

15:16.310 --> 15:18.170
But my dad is not easygoing.

15:18.300 --> 15:19.250
He's not that easy to deal with.

15:20.020 --> 15:22.340
Is it possible that someone 
else has taken a photo of you

15:23.230 --> 15:24.730
or you have taken a group photo with others?

15:25.550 --> 15:26.890
Xu Shanshan!

15:27.660 --> 15:30.810
Shanshan's phone may have my photos, and...

15:31.440 --> 15:33.520
And when Liu Min was controlled,

15:34.040 --> 15:35.900
he got Shanshan's phone.

15:36.600 --> 15:38.170
I'll call Shanshan and ask now.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.800
Hello, Qiao Ling,

15:44.280 --> 15:45.820
I was just about to ask you.

15:45.820 --> 15:47.800
I heard that Liu Min committed suicide.

15:47.800 --> 15:48.690
Is it true?

15:49.330 --> 15:50.130
Shanshan,

15:50.190 --> 15:52.380
Let's talk about Liu Min later.

15:52.640 --> 15:55.690
Can you check if there is any 
photo of me in your phone first?

15:56.090 --> 15:58.400
Ah? A photo of you?

15:59.460 --> 16:00.700
Hold on, let me see.

16:01.690 --> 16:03.660
Or maybe a photo of us!

16:06.480 --> 16:07.320
I found one.

16:07.760 --> 16:09.900
A selfie I took at the entrance 
of your photo studio.

16:09.900 --> 16:10.950
You are in the background!

16:11.780 --> 16:13.190
Captain Xiao, we found it.

16:13.580 --> 16:14.500
There is one indeed!

16:15.050 --> 16:16.100
Then, Shanshan,

16:16.200 --> 16:19.530
Can you check if this photo 
was sent to any stranger?

16:21.040 --> 16:24.220
On the night when Liu Min was arrested.

16:24.410 --> 16:26.290
Hold on, I'm on it.

16:26.650 --> 16:28.030
Let me check my email box.

16:29.180 --> 16:30.250
Don't forget the MMS.

16:30.480 --> 16:32.050
Did she send it to a stranger's number?

16:32.820 --> 16:35.420
Lu Guang, where are we going?

16:35.670 --> 16:37.060
As soon as I pack up my stuff,

16:37.060 --> 16:38.060
we can go out and play.

16:39.060 --> 16:40.090
We’re gonna go out suddenly.

16:40.630 --> 16:42.730
Is it because of my mistake just now?

16:43.360 --> 16:45.930
It's OK. I can see where they're going.

16:46.270 --> 16:48.680
That means nothing significant has changed.

16:50.530 --> 16:51.970
I still haven't found anything.

16:53.120 --> 16:55.070
Why does Qiao Ling want these records?

16:55.370 --> 16:58.040
It's also possible that the person 
deleted the records after sending it.

16:58.730 --> 17:01.490
Qiao Ling, give me Xu 
Shanshan's phone number.

17:01.760 --> 17:03.490
I'll ask my colleagues to contact the 
communication company to check this.

17:06.750 --> 17:08.300
Xixi, come.

17:08.420 --> 17:09.770
We have a follow-up visit today.

17:10.050 --> 17:11.990
Sit down and let Dr. Qin take a look.

17:13.040 --> 17:16.810
How does she feel after the 
last course of treatment?

17:17.330 --> 17:20.050
Dr. Qin, Xixi spoke today.

17:20.180 --> 17:21.990
I heard her say "OK" with my own ears.

17:22.560 --> 17:27.200
Really? It seems that the 
prescription is effective.

17:29.980 --> 17:31.540
What a quack!

17:32.550 --> 17:33.840
Mind your words.

17:34.190 --> 17:35.490
Didn't I tell you,

17:35.690 --> 17:38.580
you can choose not to believe 
what you don't understand,

17:38.930 --> 17:40.100
but you must respect it.

17:41.020 --> 17:43.220
I’m always telling you not to play 
games too often and read more books.

17:43.410 --> 17:45.850
If you have more knowledge, you 
won't be arrogant and ignorant.

17:46.410 --> 17:48.130
Is Lu Guang always like this?

17:49.710 --> 17:51.840
Educating Cheng Xiaoshi 
as if he were a child?

17:53.010 --> 17:56.080
He's a bit more mature mentally.

17:57.080 --> 17:59.600
But these medicines don’t 
show efficacy or side effects.

17:59.600 --> 18:01.240
Come, give me your hand.

18:02.370 --> 18:03.940
Let me check your pulse

18:03.940 --> 18:07.160
to decide the method for the next course.

18:07.420 --> 18:09.770
Xixi, it's not the first time.

18:09.930 --> 18:12.450
The doctor just needs to 
touch your wrist, come on.

18:12.610 --> 18:15.590
He won't notice me while 
checking her pulse, right?

18:16.660 --> 18:17.460
Look at yourself.

18:17.860 --> 18:19.190
Now you believe in this, huh?

18:43.550 --> 18:45.870
Doctor Qin, is there any problem?

18:48.100 --> 18:49.750
How strange!

18:50.130 --> 18:52.620
Her pulse indicates that she’s not a girl

18:52.620 --> 18:54.420
but a boy instead.

18:54.990 --> 18:58.460
Ah? What exactly does this mean?

19:00.910 --> 19:02.580
It means the prescription is effective!

19:02.580 --> 19:05.320
The child's pulse is getting stronger.

19:05.320 --> 19:08.380
She will recover soon with 
stronger energy and blood!

19:08.380 --> 19:10.780
He can really notice this from the pulse?

19:11.420 --> 19:13.690
That's great! Thank you, Dr. Qin!

19:14.000 --> 19:15.450
Thank you so much!

19:18.980 --> 19:21.310
Dr. Qin definitely lives 
up to his reputation.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.540
He's really a miracle doctor,

19:22.930 --> 19:25.380
Xixi spoke today!

19:25.900 --> 19:27.300
Here is Dongmao Road.

19:27.640 --> 19:30.260
I can see a cybercafe called Gorilla 
Cybercafe at the intersection.

19:30.740 --> 19:31.570
There is a Yongsen Hair 
Salon across the street.

19:31.570 --> 19:32.840
Dongmao Road, Gorilla Cybercafe,
Yongsen Hair Salon.

19:31.570 --> 19:32.840
There is a Yongsen Hair Salon across the street.

19:32.840 --> 19:34.780
Dongmao Road, Gorilla Cybercafe, 
Yongsen Hair Salon.

19:35.610 --> 19:37.580
According to the clinic address,

19:37.840 --> 19:40.290
and the description given by 
Cheng Xiaoshi along the way,

19:40.700 --> 19:43.060
it should be in the area 
east of Nande District.

19:43.420 --> 19:46.340
Wait for Cheng Xiaoshi to check the exact 
name and number of the neighborhood,

19:46.340 --> 19:47.520
and we can basically get the location.

19:48.560 --> 19:49.960
But what's the relationship

19:50.290 --> 19:52.740
between the person who sent the photo and 
the mother and daughter in the photo?

19:53.800 --> 19:55.900
What does this message mean?

19:56.860 --> 19:57.940
Stop here for a moment.

19:58.260 --> 19:59.600
Then help the mother carry a bag of medicine.

20:00.120 --> 20:02.000
Ah? Now?

20:02.700 --> 20:06.990
Yes, the child noticed that her 
mother couldn't carry it alone.

20:11.630 --> 20:13.200
Xixi, what's up?

20:15.820 --> 20:16.600
I’m fine.

20:16.850 --> 20:18.140
Mommy can do it.

20:18.880 --> 20:19.380
Don't...

20:26.500 --> 20:28.700
Xixi is indeed different today,

20:28.890 --> 20:30.140
even more powerful!

20:30.850 --> 20:32.740
Idiot, don't get carried away.

20:33.040 --> 20:34.130
Pay attention to your acting!

20:57.750 --> 20:59.290
From the message,

20:59.400 --> 21:00.820
this little girl

21:00.990 --> 21:02.540
should have a brother?

21:03.610 --> 21:06.180
But what does this have to do 
with Qian Jin and Liu Min...

21:08.720 --> 21:10.540
Too many clues, just a mess.

21:13.000 --> 21:15.250
Hello, did Wang find anything?

21:16.060 --> 21:18.190
That number did send an 
MMS message that night!

21:18.980 --> 21:20.280
Looks like he ’s pretty cunning.

21:20.640 --> 21:22.060
The records in this phone have been deleted.

21:22.350 --> 21:23.690
Go ahead.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.970
Have you found out who’s 
the owner of that number?

21:31.370 --> 21:33.040
Good! Good!

21:33.140 --> 21:33.980
Got it!

21:42.700 --> 21:44.990
What a pity! So close!

21:48.580 --> 21:49.920
The last two coins.

21:50.160 --> 21:51.920
Xixi, it counts on you!

21:54.970 --> 21:56.130
Check me out!

22:03.280 --> 22:04.900
You rigged, broken machine!

22:07.120 --> 22:07.870
Xixi,

22:08.000 --> 22:09.740
one more chance, come on!

22:11.920 --> 22:12.970
The owner's name is Liu Lan,

22:12.970 --> 22:15.730
living at Room 607, No. 48, 
Tongli Lane, Nande District.

22:16.490 --> 22:22.600
Go! Go! Go! Go!

22:23.060 --> 22:24.180
But strangely,

22:24.180 --> 22:25.920
she passed away a few years ago.

22:29.940 --> 22:30.740
What?

22:32.240 --> 22:33.740
Xu Shanshan sent an MMS

22:34.580 --> 22:36.160
to a person who's already dead?!

22:36.530 --> 22:37.220
Yes.

22:37.460 --> 22:39.260
This is the information provided 
by the communication company.

22:39.430 --> 22:40.820
I even double-checked it several times.

22:40.970 --> 22:42.060
Holy shit.

22:42.990 --> 22:44.360
Then who is this Liu Lan?

22:45.740 --> 22:47.890
Captain Xiao, there's another tricky issue.

22:47.890 --> 22:49.570
You may need to come back 
as soon as possible.

22:50.340 --> 22:51.130
What?

22:51.740 --> 22:52.980
A witness came to report the case?

23:02.980 --> 23:03.500
Yes.

23:04.410 --> 23:06.700
That person claims to see 
everything about all the cases.

23:13.850 --> 23:14.940
What else did that person say?

23:16.010 --> 23:16.760
Let's start.

23:17.180 --> 23:18.740
Tell us everything you know.

23:24.650 --> 23:27.010
That person would only 
speak to Cheng Xiaoshi.
